<!--Post: 8205--><!--Time: 1108984181-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST8205"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Raidar<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Raidar<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, February 21, 2005 - 3:09 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I have been thinkin this for a while. I mean i see all the drops and everything but i really think he lives away from wichita. He obviously doesnt feel threatened to keep doing drops. I think he feels secure of where he lives..still close enough,but yet far enough away.I just wonder if maybe he lives on the inside of one of the surrounding states. Does anyone know where you contact to talk to about someone. Just wondering.  <BR> <BR>RAIDAR<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 8205-->
<!--Post: 8218--><!--Time: 1109006308-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST8218"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Ztargate<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Ztargate<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, February 21, 2005 - 9:18 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Reminds me of Ted Kacksinski. He attacked people in California and othe states, but none in his home-state. <BR> <BR>Who was to say before he was caught, that the person lived in the middle of nowhere, miles away from his victims? <BR> <BR>Then again, he might be under their very noses. <BR> <BR>:|<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 8218-->
<!--Post: 8294--><!--Time: 1109040317-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST8294"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:bmodule_244@hotmail.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Bmodule<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Bmodule<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, February 21, 2005 - 6:45 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->&#34;After a thing like Fox, I come home and go about life like anyone else. And I will be like that until the urge hits me again.&#34; <BR> <BR>&#34;come home and go about life&#34; <BR> <BR>Either his life focuses around his home...or he was far away from home when he murdered Nancy Fox. Nothing definate, but possibly an exploitable slip of the tongue. <BR> <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 8294-->
<!--Post: 8296--><!--Time: 1109041352-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST8296"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Raidar<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Raidar<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, February 21, 2005 - 7:02 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->That is a good point Bmodule. I was just thinkin about the drops he has been doin. I mean he could live 100 or 200 miles away and just drive there to do the drops.Could be Okla. or Mo. i just think there is a chance of this. I do have a few more feelings, just kinda scared to voice my opinion.  <BR> <BR>RAIDAR<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 8296-->
<!--Post: 8300--><!--Time: 1109041627-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST8300"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Ztargate<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Ztargate<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, February 21, 2005 - 7:07 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Being that the area is known for aircraft businesses and manufacturers, one has to consider the possibility that he owns a plane. If that&#39;s the case, then he could be anywhere from Canada to Florida, or from California to New York. <BR> <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 8300-->
<!--Post: 8306--><!--Time: 1109046517-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST8306"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:bmodule_244@hotmail.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Bmodule<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Bmodule<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, February 21, 2005 - 8:28 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Speak up Raidar. BTK uses disimformation to cover his trail, leaving false clues. The cops are baffled because they look for solid evidence being afraid they will look dumb for examining false leads. I say : Investigate everything, believe nothing, The truth will shake out from cross-referencing and patterns. <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 8306-->
<!--Post: 8336--><!--Time: 1109062082-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST8336"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Metalhead<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Metalhead<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, February 22, 2005 - 12:48 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->he watches the local news in wichita so he would have to live there or close by.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 8336-->
<!--Post: 8340--><!--Time: 1109076585-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST8340"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Raidar<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Raidar<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, February 22, 2005 - 4:49 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I live in Southeast TX and i watch everything on the news about BTK on my laptop from Wichita News. I even watch my hometown news when im away, so if he is computer savey he can do the same.  <BR> <BR>RAIDAR<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 8340-->
<!--Post: 10213--><!--Time: 1109819545-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10213"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Chiquitah<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Chiquitah<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, March 02, 2005 - 7:12 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->You all thinking what I am thinking? <BR> <BR>Who is RAIDAR????<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 10213-->
<!--Post: 10215--><!--Time: 1109819938-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10215"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:vscantu1@msn.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Vscantu<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Vscantu<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, March 02, 2005 - 7:18 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Was it &#34;DENNY THE DOG CATCHER&#34;? <BR> <BR>If not, RAIDAR, please post here &amp; say &#34;Ali-ali, oxen-free!!&#34;<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 10215-->
<!--Post: 10217--><!--Time: 1109820827-->
